Subject: [PATCH] Add identity-dimension probes (notebook 02)

- src/benchbias/identity_probes.py: one-vs-rest logistic probes per identity
  dimension on frozen embeddings, control-task selectivity, direction
  similarity, transfer check, per-cluster driver profiles, co-activation,
  per-language centering
- src/benchbias/heseia.py: HESEIA CSV loader with configurable columns and
  label map (unmapped labels kept as own dimensions)
- notebooks/02_identity_probes.ipynb: HESEIA-trained probes applied to BBQ
  clusters; fine-tuning only as optional comparison
- notebook 01 now exports cluster assignments for notebook 02
- tests, decision log, research design, data sources

